---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Contribute">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Contributing guide</h1>
  <div class="prose mt-6 max-w-3xl text-stone-700">
    <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">Submitting agreements</h2>
    <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
      <li>Only submit documents that are publicly available. Always include the source URL.</li>
      <li>PDF preferred. Scanned documents must have a text layer.</li>
      <li>Check the duplicate detector's response before resubmitting.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">Editing AI analyses</h2>
    <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
      <li>Correct facts only against the original document — cite the relevant section or page in your edit summary.</li>
      <li>Keep summaries neutral and factual. No commentary on unions or employers beyond what the document states.</li>
      <li>Translate foreign-language quotes rather than rewriting them silently; keep originals where they matter.</li>
      <li>New users' edits are reviewed by moderators before publishing. Trusted editors publish instantly.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">Becoming a trusted editor</h2>
    <p class="mt-2">
      Have {5} edits approved and you are promoted automatically, or a moderator can grant it
      earlier.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold">What does not belong here</h2>
    <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
      <li>Private or leaked documents, personal data beyond what is inherent to the public agreement.</li>
      <li>Individual employment contracts — collective agreements cover groups of workers.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
